<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Boss, thank you for everything."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Momoko-chan<STYLE ID="1">, are you really―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm sorry, I've got a lot going on myself..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I understand that, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haah... I'll never find another girl better than </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE><PG>
"That's not true. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="みはら">Mihara</STYLE>-san and Sayaka-chan are both full-fledged Primavera waitresses now. 
{PAUSE ""}
I trained them thoroughly, after all."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I suppose so... </STYLE>Momoko-chan<STYLE ID="1">, we can't keep relying on you forever. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Thank you so much, for everything until now."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sei_ge_cowbell01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―Hah! Hah! Oh, thank goodness! I made it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wait, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="みはら">Mihara</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-san, we have customers..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―But Boss! Today is </STYLE>Momoko-san's<STYLE ID="1"> last day at work!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I started working here because I looked up to </STYLE>Momoko-san<STYLE ID="1">, and yet... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To think I won't get to see </STYLE>Momoko-san<STYLE ID="1"> like this anymore... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Uu...</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="みはら">Mihara</STYLE>-san, no crying. 
{PAUSE ""}
I never taught you it was okay to cry in the shop, did I?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―But, but! </STYLE>Momoko-san<STYLE ID="1"> won't be here anymore...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"As long as you and Sayaka-chan are here, this shop will be fine."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">―</STYLE>Momoko-san<STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even just as a customer is fine, so please make sure you come here again!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">―For sure, okay!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, of course. I'll come again."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―That's a promise! Be sure to come again!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, a promise. I've never lied to you, have I?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Y-yes!</STYLE><PG>
"Okay, then go get changed. Your shift starts now, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">―Okay! </STYLE>Momoko-san<STYLE ID="1">, thank you for everything!</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
